Package: vela-wallet
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Monday Labs <hello@getvela.app>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://getvela.app
Description: Self-custodial smart wallet for EVM networks
 Vela Wallet is a self-custodial smart account wallet for EVM networks.
 Accounts are Safe smart contracts with ERC-4337 account abstraction, and
 transactions are signed with a passkey - there is no seed phrase and no
 private key to store.
 .
 Balances and USD prices for 12 EVM networks appear in a single view, priced
 from on-chain DEX quotes with a Chainlink oracle fallback.
